    "title": "Anbernic RG34XXSP Retro Handheld Gaming Console - Linux OS, 3.4-inch IPS Display (720x480), 5000+ Classic Games, 64GB Card. Features 3300mAh Battery, WiFi, HDMI & Bluetooth",
    "body_html": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Service &amp; Warranty Policy</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 14px;\">Please read carefully before purchasing</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 25px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f0f4ff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">7-Days Warranty</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Anbernic does not provide warranty services in India. If there is any issues within 7 days replacement period, we will provide the replacement<br><span style=\"color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px;\">*Requires valid photos/videos of the defect to process the claim.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #ecfdf5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Software &amp; SD Card Support</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Pre-installed games and OS are provided by Anbernic. For software issues, users must re-flash the SD card by downloading the official firmware here: <a href=\"https://win.anbernic.com/download/\" style=\"color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #2563eb;\" target=\"_blank\">Anbernic Download Center</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #fff1f2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Final Sale Policy</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">We exclusively sell <strong>brand-new products</strong>. As Anbernic does not accept returns, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds. Please conduct thorough research before completing your purchase.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e1e4e8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Authentic Products \u2022 Professional Support</span></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOhOVRVyvOiPH22XpOF3DTj0NLj3lkk9rNfdassyOukMydh7lFEcAT1X-h692uEINQe-Hy2By4UlZxYRnJ0pUJiazHXz0sKh8dpomA3q2hQX-RFzR0u-eUuDX2jBWyVZ8M9d-dF1TuxPlh4UbgdK0jF=w1271-h1271-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOxJeX2xvwhXa9gql_3DScWqRMwl9qNcbV1P-4NlO819kexfiVz3p8oDFCQQvUQ09iYtl80vZilojJ1k5Z_l0cL_rZRBeCbdN2Nn15OPCxK0thj7LCuKtT2QNjHDRtKkVtHsMf-eRcp5nE-Jp-Mj-eN=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPItmkGlQmTXem7r7L5cQeELUtDKAO9Zhbxis8CiLkQrPNGl-NUQgRwjlN1fCaVq2OvQJ2Y2ExuNhqJ_GRsAnlJ17vXbfo2S7McNy3baw5QB5pwV6ep63dSbjCnEw8IXlFSodDuQeAAW__maWIGadYf=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOgD0B2mboeaQ0wty40OXnZ7jXbfwDKRvaZ567Wkvs5BNq7SfnlumJ4rZxnP92m-rT3G795P72OIhSotV7TpiaTGWLjQb2vXw43pI_rctIHJr7R06CJLXK-KTMrgUSgvEvLHSTV8QWEYDhz3FiXJntH=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM0EwqZROODC5sW5Nx1epC1Bn_-4MQxPbOis2C5gSXUUmADAiIRutx2uPampmFgBE0WafRQEn41Bie7AyhNSqyd0z0YNQVVFOC02eucAGmgFGH7sGDoVDv2zLJ5OLrumiO7r2NxSiL2Hbgl5MI75RRM=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN3GU-iZcMJMALTKnCq5IsZlPNjwnpC6w5zUAsXkHKIkPnv-pmHQd2M_tn3pGlHx6Xo1dD0EUekbulDeMX23hBrXTVnTKY6iDiJbFY9cNEnzb7Gf5Mn8VfD4k380JYmNwuXL-zJf_o0QMWSpaOeecwO=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP4vqYBmd65cM4SYtY3dYGn_E5WseVgOKxBA5TwN8cywrW22vpvwjO0kaI6hQMtaprezYPdADQRjvVIC9HEYyaXEz3V8a41dkg62yI9fiP2KQZdg5SEQGOEQlvtw7ULfA1Rh61Pu542zMHhOcoVhd0W=w1200-h1200-s-no-gm?authuser=1\"></span></strong></p>\n<!-- \ud83d\udd25 Anbernic RG34XXSP | Card-style Spec Sheet for Shopify -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 Anbernic <span style=\"color: #f59e0b;\">RG34XXSP</span>\n</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">Clamshell Design \u2022 3.4\" IPS \u2022 H700 Quad-Core \u2022 2GB RAM \u2022 Hall Sleep</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #111827; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Colors</strong><br>Yellow / Gray / Black / Indigo</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display</strong><br>3.4\" IPS, full viewing angle<br>OCA full lamination \u2022 720 \u00d7 480</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>H700 Quad-Core ARM Cortex-A53 @ 1.5 GHz</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>Dual-Core G31 MP2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>2 GB LPDDR4</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>64 GB TF / MicroSD included<br>Dual TF slots \u2014 expandable up to 512 GB</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>Linux 64-bit</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Game Support</strong><br>30+ emulators &amp; ported games<br>User-downloadable formats</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless</strong><br>Wi\u2011Fi 2.4G / 5G (802.11 a/b/g/n/ac)<br>Bluetooth 4.2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Multimedia</strong><br>Video &amp; music player<br>File manager \u2022 TXT e\u2011book \u2022 WiliWili online playback</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Languages</strong><br>CN / EN / JP / KR / RU / FR / DE / ES / PT</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Speaker</strong><br>High-fidelity built-in speaker</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Battery</strong><br>3300 mAh polymer lithium \u2014 up to 6 hours</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Charging</strong><br>5V / 1.5A \u2014 supports USB\u2011C to USB\u2011C charging</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Hall Magnetic Switch</strong><br>Magnetic lid closure<br>Auto sleep/wake when opened or closed</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Extra Functions</strong><br>Wireless &amp; wired controllers<br>Bluetooth controllers \u2022 HDMI TV out<br>Vibration \u2022 Online multiplayer \u2022 Streaming</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Accessories</strong><br>USB charging cable \u2022 Gift box \u2022 Manual \u2022 Screen protector</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions</strong><br>83 \u00d7 82 \u00d7 25 mm</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #334155; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Weight</strong><br>178 g</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">Clamshell nostalgia \u2022 Hall sleep \u2022 2GB RAM upgrade</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
